    \u0432\u0434\u0430\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0448\u0438 \u0436\u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E
    \u0445\u0438\u0431\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043C\u0435\u0442\u0430."
  - "Fang 3 gemmere i \xE9n runde uden at ramme en forkert ting."
  - "Fang 3 gjemmere i \xE9n runde uten \xE5 treffe feil ting."
  - "Nappaa 3 piiloutujaa yhdess\xE4 er\xE4ss\xE4 osumatta v\xE4\xE4r\xE4\xE4n esineeseen."
  - "Kapj el 3 b\xFAj\xF3t egy k\xF6rben \xFAgy, hogy nem \xFCtsz meg t\xE9ves t\xE1rgyat."
  - "Chy\u0165 3 skr\xFDva\u010De v jednom kole bez z\xE1sahu \u0161patn\xE9ho p\u0159edm\u011Btu."
  - "Tek turda yanl\u0131\u015F e\u015Fyaya vurmadan 3 saklanan yakala."
  - "Prinde 3 ascun\u0219i \xEEntr-o rund\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 love\u0219ti
    vreun obiect gre\u0219it."
  - "B\u1EAFt 3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi tr\u1ED1n trong m\u1ED9t v\xE1n m\xE0 kh\xF4ng \u0111\xE1nh
